{'symbol': 'URI', 'date': '2021-07-30 16:15:00', 'title': 'UNITED RENTALS ANNOUNCES PRICING OF OFFERING OF $750 MILLION OF 3.750% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2032', 'text': "STAMFORD, CONN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--UNITED RENTALS, INC. (NYSE: URI) (“URI”) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS SUBSIDIARY, UNITED RENTALS (NORTH AMERICA), INC. (“URNA”), HAS PRICED AN OFFERING OF $750 MILLION PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 3.750% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2032 (THE “NOTES”) IN A REGISTERED PUBLIC OFFERING. THE NOTES OFFERED BY URNA WILL RANK: EQUALLY IN RIGHT OF PAYMENT WITH ALL OF URNA'S EXISTING AND FUTURE SENIOR INDEBTEDNESS, EFFECTIVELY JUNIOR TO ANY OF URNA'S EXISTING AND FUTURE SECURED INDEBTEDNESS TO"}